    "title": "When is Earth Day? How it started, Earth Day activity ideas",
    "text": "LIFESTYLEEarth Day: Origins, 2025 date, Earth Day activities to help you celebrate this year Mariyam MuhammadColumbus DispatchApril 1, 2025, 2:46 p.m. ETOh, how we love Mother Earth, don't we? Earth is our home and has given us so much — green grass, sunny skies, breathtaking sunsets and beautiful snow — so why not celebrate it by taking one day to make it a better, healthier place?When you were younger, you may have learned that April 22 is Earth Day. For more than 50 years, Earth Day has been about celebrating our planet and its glory, promoting environmental protection, and demonstrating the importance of planetary health.",
